OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few
OL,6,Fshowers are possible this evening,
OL,7,Fperhaps even thunderstorms, these
OL,8,Fmostly in the south. Becoming
OL,9,Fgenerally dry overnight. Not as
OL,10,Funcomfortably warm as last night but
OL,11,Fremaining rather warm, especially in
OL,12,Furban areas, with a light
OL,13,Fnorthwesterly breeze.
OL,14,
OL,15,CSaturday:FIsolated showers though the
OL,16,Fmorning clearing away, then a dry day
OL,17,Ffor most with a mixture of sunny
OL,18,Fperiods and occasional cloudier
OL,19,Fspells. A light northwesterly breeze
OL,20,Fand feeling warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
