OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FLargely
OL,6,Fdry to begin this periods with bright
OL,7,For sunny spells, interspersed with
OL,8,Fsome cloud. Turning breezier by
OL,9,FTuesday with the chance of some rain.
OL,10,FTemperatures near average.
